;Normal sale, assumes already logged in

Alias scanfield 90 674

Assert color 86 13 #000091 ;ensures someone is logged in
Assert color 835 640 #f0f0f0 ;ensure no club card
Mouseclick scanfield
TypeText 9414982020900 ;kenya bold
PressKey Enter
Sleep 5000

//add in Club+ card
TypeText 6059174200000008 ;club+ card
PressKey Enter
Sleep 2000 ;give time to load balance and graphic

Assert color 835 640 #a59ae9 ;ensure club card present, purple logo
Assert color 803 648 #181913 ;ensure club card present, black C

//Now pay with cash

Alias "Complete sale" 1758 740
Alias cash_dialog 506 366
Alias top_button 552 173
Alias "Print least" 470 290

//complete cash payment
//assumes there is at least 1 item in the sale

MouseClick "Complete sale"
Sleep 1000

ClickButton Payment OK ;this auto selects Cash
Sleep 1000

MouseClick top_button
Sleep 2000

MouseClick "Print least"
Sleep 1000 ;allows time to complete the sale, ready for next test
